            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot 0.28.0 learned a few new tricks</h3><ul><li>Each kind of call gets its own report, with a scorecard for interviews.</li><li>Rewrite an old report with any profile, and undo it in one click.</li><li>Share profiles with a colleague, or let Claude suggest a better one for you to review.</li><li>A parrot in your menu bar shows the call time, and Join &amp; Record starts your next call.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.28.0">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
